{
  "slug": "daily-journal",
  "name": "Daily Journal",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Plugin description: Conversational daily journaling for Obsidian vaults. Interviews you about your day, detects your emotional altitude using a 34-floor framework (from survival-mode lows to flow-state highs), tracks habits (gym, sleep, meditation), and saves structured markdown entries with YAML frontmatter. Optional advisory panel adds 1-2 sentences of pushback from named advisors. Works with any Obsidian vault.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `daily-journal` (Use this skill when the user wants to journal, do a daily check-in, process their day, or says…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install daily-journal@claude-community` from `adelaidasofia/claude-daily-journal`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
